<===> README.md
A `with` configuration only reaches modules loaded through `@forward` or
`@import`. A module loaded via `@use` (or `meta.load-css()`) without its own
`with` is not configured by an outer one, so an unused outer configuration
variable is an error.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> through_forward/input.scss
@use "midstream" with ($x: configured);
<===> through_forward/_midstream.scss
@forward "upstream";
<===> through_forward/_upstream.scss
$x: original !default;
b {c: $x}
<===> through_forward/output.css
b {
  c: configured;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> through_import/input.scss
@use "midstream" with ($x: configured);
<===> through_import/_midstream.scss
@import "upstream";
<===> through_import/_upstream.scss
$x: original !default;
b {c: $x}
<===> through_import/output.css
b {
  c: configured;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> use_without_with/input.scss
@use "midstream";
<===> use_without_with/_midstream.scss
$x: outer;
@use "upstream";
<===> use_without_with/_upstream.scss
$x: original !default;
b {c: $x}
<===> use_without_with/output.css
b {
  c: original;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> error/through_load_css/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@include meta.load-css("midstream", $with: (x: configured));
<===> error/through_load_css/_midstream.scss
@use "upstream";
<===> error/through_load_css/_upstream.scss
$x: original !default;
b {c: $x}
<===> error/through_load_css/error
Error: $x was not declared with !default in the @used module.
  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("midstream", $with: (x: configured));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet
<===> error/through_load_css/error-libsass
Error: $x was not declared with !default in the @used module.
  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("midstream", $with: (x: configured));
  |                                             ^
  '
  input.scss 2:45  load-css()
  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("midstream", $with: (x: configured));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:1   root stylesheet
